  <!-- Hero text under the page title -->
  <Fragment slot="lede">Mozambique is among the countries most exposed to tropical cyclones, floods and drought in the South-West Indian Ocean basin.</Fragment>

  <!-- Country context: shown in full -->
  <Fragment slot="context">
    <p>Mozambique is among the countries most exposed to tropical cyclones, floods and drought in the South-West Indian Ocean basin. Cyclone Gombe alone affected over 700,000 people and displaced 23,000, and the 2023–2024 El Niño dry spell caused widespread crop failure across Southern Africa.</p>
    <p>RE2CLID targets action areas in Sofala and Tete provinces, with WFP as programme partner in Mozambique. A Technical Implementation Package for Mozambique was not included in the source pack, so this summary uses the cluster Description of the Action.</p>
  </Fragment>

